        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4701, Traditional Beaded Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe beading on this door pull not only adds classic beauty to this piece, but it also provides an ergonomic grip. This 12 inch c.c. handle can be used on doors as well as appliances. It is available in 6 beautiful finishes including timeless oil rubbed bronze and the ever popular satin nickel (pictured right). Made by RK International, the Beaded Middle Door Pull is sure to add traditional glamor to any space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/beaded-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3701\"><b>Beaded Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the PH-4701 Decorative Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
